It suits travellers who want a choice of sea view or pool view rooms in Camps Bay, with a discount available for booking directly.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.61oncampsbay.co.za/contact/contact-us/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = '61-on-camps-bay-camps-bay' AND description = '61 On Camps Bay is a three-star luxury guest house with seven en-suite bedrooms -- several with sea-facing patios, others pool-facing with a kitchenette -- built around an outdoor plunge pool and terrace with panoramic Atlantic views, a short walk from Camps Bay beach.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
